    feat: text-only Mistral-Small-24B + GPQA and ARC (multiple-choice) datasets
    
    - catalog: replace the multimodal Mistral-Small-3.1-24B-2503 (which this
      text-only harness can't load) with text-only mistralai/Mistral-Small-Instruct-2409
      (22B, MistralForCausalLM). Gated -> needs HF_TOKEN + accepted license.
    - datasets: add ARC-Challenge (allenai/ai2_arc, public) and GPQA main
      (Idavidrein/gpqa, gated) as task sources. Both are multiple-choice:
      options relabeled A.. (GPQA options deterministically shuffled per item),
      gold mapped to the new letter.
    - grading: new answer_type "mcq" with normalize_mcq_answer (extracts the choice
      letter from 'B', '(C)', 'Answer: D', 'The answer is A', boxed, etc.), wired
      into normalize_answer / verify_answer / extract_typed_answer / load_tasks /
      --task-source choices; registered arc+gpqa in the matrix DATASETS. Tests 30/30.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

